  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU for Youth (EU4Youth) aims to provide technical assistance to support the pilot implementation of the Youth Guarantee Scheme in Albania. It is a strategic response to the pressing challenges faced by the countrys youth, particularly those aged 15-29, in accessing sustainable employment opportunities. EU for Youth aims to harmonize Albanias youth employment policies with European Council recommendations on Youth Guarantee, ensuring universal accessibility for young individuals not in educatio</narrative>
  </description>
